{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"protobuf","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Protocol Buffers","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Protocol Buffers (.proto).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"protobuf","name":"Protocol Buffers","extensions":[".proto"],"grammar":"grammars/protobuf.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Protocol Buffers","path":"snippets/protobuf.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/protobuf.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:extensions|reserved|repeated|optional|required|package|message|service|returns|syntax|import|option|stream|extend|public|oneof|enum|weak|rpc|map|max|to)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:sfixed32|sfixed64|fixed32|fixed64|double|uint32|uint64|sint32|sint64|string|float|int32|int64|bytes|bool)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/protobuf.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Message\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"msg\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"message ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\t${2:string} ${3:field} = ${4:1};\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A message\"\n  },\n  \"Service\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"svc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"service ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\trpc ${2:Call}(${3:Request}) returns (${4:Response});\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A service\"\n  },\n  \"Enum\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"enum\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"enum ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\t${2:UNKNOWN} = 0;\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An enum\"\n  },\n  \"File header\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"proto\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"syntax = \\\"proto3\\\";\",\n      \"\",\n      \"package ${1:example};\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A proto3 header\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Protocol Buffers\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Protocol Buffers.\n\n## Files\n\n`.proto`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `msg` | A message |\n| `svc` | A service |\n| `enum` | An enum |\n| `proto` | A proto3 header |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}